# Build context of Dockerfile.orchestrator: the workspace sources, without build output, history
# or the trees the daemon does not compile. rust-toolchain.toml is left out so the builder image's
# own pinned toolchain builds instead of rustup fetching `stable`.
.git
target
target-shared
**/node_modules
docs
site
specs
evals
*.whl
rust-toolchain.toml
# Local secrets, gitignored too: never in a build context.
**/.env*
